  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMART CULTURAL TOURISM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. Protected and promoted cultural heritage in Municipality of Pustec;1.2. Initiated cooperation, understanding and respect of cultural heritagein the cross-border region;1.3. Improved touristic offer and increased number of visitors in theregion;1.4. Increased public awareness on cultural heritage values;2.1. Eased accessibility and implemented appropriate ambiental solutioncorresponding to the archaeological site;2.2. Initiated use of renewable energy resources</narrative>
  </description>
